ng her a rare Korean-American idol?"}, {"correct": 1, "options": ["Glastonbury", "Coachella", "Lollapalooza", "Rolling Loud"], "fun_fact": "LE SSERAFIM performed at Coachella 2023 as part of the festival's first Coachella Korea stage, further cementing their global profile.", "question": "LE SSERAFIM performed at which major festival in 2023, building on a K-pop festival presence?"}, {"correct": 3, "options": ["FEARLESS", "ANTIFRAGILE", "UNFORGIVEN", "Easy"], "fun_fact": "Easy, released in February 2024, became LE SSERAFIM's most internationally successful song to date, gaining massive traction on streaming platforms globally.", "question": "Which LE SSERAFIM song became their breakout international hit in 2023?"}, {"correct": 2, "options": ["2004", "2005", "2006", "2007"], "fun_fact": "Eunchae (Hong Eun-chae) was born on November 10, 2006, making her the youngest member of LE SSERAFIM. She joined after the initial lineup was reduced to 5.", "question": "Eunchae is the youngest member of LE SSERAFIM. She was born in which year?"}, {"correct": 2, "options": ["#7", "#22", "#57", "#100"], "fun_fact": "ANTIFRAGILE peaked at #57 on the Billboard Hot 100, making it one of the highest-charting K-pop girl group songs on the chart at the time of release.", "question": "LE SSERAFIM's ANTIFRAGILE (2022) peaked at what position on the Billboard Hot 100?"}]$quiz$::jsonb
